-**Algorithm Steps:**
-1. Initialize the iteration variable $z$ to the input point $p_{in}$:
-   $$z = p_{in}$$
-2. Initialize the squared distance $z_{dist}$ to the squared length of $z$:
-   $$z_{dist} = z.x^2 + z.y^2 + z.z^2$$
