-   b. Update $z$ by adding the original input point $p_{in}$ to the new coordinates:
-      $$z = p_{new} + p_{in}$$
-   c. Update the squared distance:
-      $$z_{dist} = z.x^2 + z.y^2 + z.z^2$$
